@api = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness: the process is running
GET {{api}}/health/live

### Readiness: the database is reachable
GET {{api}}/health/ready

### Unknown route: 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{api}}/does-not-exist

### Games list (website-only: uses the development internal key)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/games?lang=es
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key

### One game with its achievements
GET {{api}}/api/v1/games/zelda64-recompiled
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key
